# ---- P2c SLICE-ARMS (2026-10-23): the straight sword's LIBRARY, a000..a337 (STYLE_P2 25.7; P2C_CONTRACTS 4: degrees
# counter-clockwise from screen-right, drawn once (D) for every facing, origin = the grip, `mark tip` at the point).
# A3's construction at every angle: a 2 px blade (lit row / column toward the top-left, the back a step darker), the
# steel outline, a white tip pixel; a 4 px brass guard two steps from the grip, the leather grip under the fist (the
# hand is drawn over it), a brass pommel two steps behind. Guard to tip 11 steps, pommel to tip 15 (STYLE_P2 11). The
# 0 / 22.5 / 45 degree drawings are hand-placed; the other angles are their turns and mirrors, re-lit by hand (the lit
# edge top-left, the guard's bright end top-left) and checked at 12x.
